00:45:23.000 --> 00:45:55.000
what I'm talking about. He held that over your head forever. Fifteen years ago, Brian walked in and told you he'd done something, didn't he? He killed Mike, and I'm pretty sure the reason he was going to kill you today was he was afraid you were going to say something. Denise strongly disputed this allegation. She said she believed that Mike had drowned in Lake Seminole and she had no reason to think otherwise.

