00:53:39.000 --> 00:54:20.000
of her daughter. Denise also liked to present herself a certain way, and she was worried that leaving Mike would affect her public image. As Brian would later remark, better to be a rich widow than a poor divorcee. Brian and Denise wanted to be together full time. Although Brian couldn't pinpoint exactly who brought it up first, they started discussing ways they could get Mike out of the picture. They considered staging a robbery at Mike's office while he was working late, but ruled

