planning company. Mike already had a $500,000 policy with another provider, but he figured he could let that one lapse in exchange for a $1 million policy set up by the Winchasters. What he didn't know was that Denise planned on continuing to pay the premiums on the existing $500,000 policy so that too would remain active. Brian told investigators the plan was, quote, "...we would be together and live happily ever after, and as a side note, we'd have all this money and enjoy a wonderful life together."

