00:58:46.000 --> 00:59:21.000
December 9, 2000. Brian also arranged to go hunting with his father-in-law later that morning so that someone could verify his whereabouts. Denise would make a few calls from her landline so she could prove she'd been at home all morning. Brian and Denise would have very little contact both before and after the incident so as to not raise anyone's suspicions. Several hours before things were supposed to kick off, Denise panicked and made Mike

