01:14:08.000 --> 01:14:48.000
But he added, She was in my head, behind me. After four days of testimony, the jury deliberated for eight hours before returning their verdict. Guilty on all counts. Denise stared straight ahead in the mostly silent courtroom, as Mike's mother and brother shared a quiet emotional embrace. At the subsequent sentencing, Cheryl Williams delivered a powerful victim impact statement about her 17-year campaign to solve her son's disappearance.

